   212	```mermaid
   213	sequenceDiagram
   214	  participant Parent
   215	  participant Driver
   216	  participant ChildTUI
   217	  Parent->>Driver: start(interaction_mode=interactive, brief)
   218	  Driver->>ChildTUI: spawn PTY
   219	  loop until done or abort
   220	    ChildTUI-->>Driver: screen plus events
